<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-11-15T23:02:12.142Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 23:02:12 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Bandits in Zamfara attacked a mosque during Subhi prayer, killing Governor Dauda Lawal's aide and abducting worshippers, while separate bandit raids killed a farmer after a N56 million ransom was paid. In Benue, gunmen shot a driver and abducted three passengers on a road convoy. The military rescued 119 abducted travellers and killed terrorists in a week of operations. President Tinubu publicly sought forgiveness for his absence after the Plateau attack and announced a five-year defence plan, while AI-generated disinformation is spreading ahead of the upcoming election. The conflict recorded 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dw.com/en/nigeria-s-upcoming-election-marred-by-rising-ai-disinformation/a-79946897?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-rdf&quot;&gt;Deutsche Welle&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihAFBVV95cUxPQlR2dHlKVUFFZ0oyWHNFMmNuaVVJMHRNTHIwaXZKTk1CVkJ6empqSVoxVkc2TjJPTFYxZk9PR0UzbVZZeDRKV2FocWFqaFRUa01RVDc1TFR2N3R2T3lXbVBWWmVPQTByc05SZS1NS2dJd2Z3cDBDZmYtVHBWUTIyRzVRRnU?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxPRzVKMkhZVDRSalZjWmsyUkZvRjBsS3ozSGg4S08yY2w0VE5oTE9waFk1QlpfOTBCRTdqcy1oZFBjVGwtS3hBSDFiYnh3VGpuaVMtQ3hCcjFxLTNubU1WZW5hb0h5Unl1NU5WOUY4MS1vUXE2VXJtejNOaFBUZUJsLXc2Z2M1WUdERUJXX3kyZWxoY2duQWJYcG9raGszME0?oc=5&quot;&gt;Head Topics&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxQQzhkVDZrLTE1cjBkbnBmY2RKbWZJQlQ3UGNHVS1yaFpDWFh3YlRGeWU2aU5CZWFDNmZnMnF0ZVpPY3JfWS05bTVaYlFqVkNkLWJKS1VWR0dTM2NwdFVJSnBEZGFac3hUempnZEhoaXpYdEtJLWNNaEJ5YlBFR3FKTWw0TmxhOGowUFRDSncyVVBmX3VZaWhNdlpVWU95REdO?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Sun Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxPckFKYkptb1lfYVJwe